---
<BaseLayout title="Encuéntranos | Mercadito de Chiloé"><section class="bg-cream px-6 py-24 md:px-[10vw] md:py-32"><p class="text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[.14em] text-orange">04 / Visítanos</p><h1 class="mt-5 font-serif text-6xl leading-none tracking-[-.06em] md:text-8xl">Nos vemos en<br /><i class="text-orange">el mercado.</i></h1><p class="mt-8 max-w-xl text-lg text-ink/70">Estamos en el corazón de Castro, a pasos de la plaza y de la vida cotidiana de la isla.</p></section><section class="grid gap-12 px-6 py-24 md:grid-cols-2 md:px-[10vw]"><div><p class="text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[.14em] text-orange">Dónde encontrarnos</p><h2 class="mt-5 font-serif text-5xl leading-none tracking-[-.05em] md:text-7xl">Blanco Encalada<br /><i class="text-orange">123.</i></h2><p class="mt-8 text-lg leading-relaxed text-ink/70">Castro, Chiloé · Chile<br />Martes a domingo<br />12:30 — 22:30</p><a class="mt-7 inline-flex rounded bg-ink px-5 py-4 text-sm font-bold text-white" href="https://maps.google.com/?q=Castro,Chiloe" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Abrir en Google Maps ↗</a></div><div class="min-h-[520px] bg-cover bg-center" style="background-image:url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1528698827591-e19ccd7bc23d?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1100&q=85')"></div></section></BaseLayout>
